## Reviewer disagreements (not applied)
fil-a #1, deleting digit 10. The reviewer is right that `pcode=G0340028&flno=3` is Article 3 of 各類所得扣繳率標準 and that the reader must not be told the link is Article 10 of that regulation. The suggested label drops the digit 10 that the Korean source still has on this line (`영업세법 제10조`). Round 3 showed that deletion fails the checker (`numbers FAIL missing from translation (1): 10`). The public label now says the link is Artikulo 3 and is not Artikulo 10 ng Batas sa Buwis sa Negosyo, which keeps the digit. The URL was not changed.

fil-a #3 is a skip under the bio pin, not a claim that "M" reads well.

fil-a #15 / fil-b #17. The zero-width lines do split the spoken columns. Deleting them, or turning Q16–Q20 into headings, fails the blocks/headings checks against the Korean source. Not a wording fix the checker will accept. fil-b #16 was applied by completing each existing block instead of merging the paragraphs.

fil-a #18. servicesAssistanceBefore already ends with a space and servicesAssistanceAfter starts with a space, but the link sits between them (`before` + link + `after`). The rendered line is "pahinang Makipag-ugnayan kung paano…", one space on each side of the link. Removing the After space would glue "Makipag-ugnayan" to "kung".
